title: Authorizations › New Case › Referral › Checklist buttons
route: /authorizations/new/:draftId?ref=RF-2053
intro: The buttons around the referral checklist: replace the documents, ask the referrer, decline, open the full page, and the main button, which changes with the referral's status and is disabled while a required item is open.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: 'Demo: the referrer replies' stands in for the referrer answering.
---
start s1 "On the referral checklist"
screen sc1 "Referral checklist\nPatient card, four sections, buttons below"

group gTop "Above the card"
  click cDiff "Click 'Use different documents'"
  process pDiff "Address becomes ?ref= (empty), so the start screen shows\nThe case keeps its old referral until you continue"
endgroup
goto gStart "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Intake › Start with a referral or patient"

group gFoot "Under the sections"
  decision dAsk "Open, not waiting, and something to ask?\n(a failed age check is never counted)"
  click cFoot "Click 'Ask the referrer for the missing item'\nor '…for the 4 missing items'"
  click cDec "Click 'Decline'\n(only while open; never disabled)"
  decision dWait "Awaiting info?"
  click cDemo "Click 'Demo: the referrer replies'"
  click cFull "Click 'Open the full referral'"
endgroup
goto gAsk "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Referral › Ask the referrer"
goto gOk "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Referral › Mark OK or decline"
goto gFull "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Referral › The full referral page"

decision dSt "Referral status?"
decision dReq "Is a required item still open?\nPatient age, credentials, signature,\ndiagnosis code, level of care, insurance and member ID"
toast tDis "'Accept referral and continue' is disabled\nLine under it: 'Resolve 4 items first: clinician credentials, clinician signature, diagnosis code, insurance and member ID.'"
process pLift "Each item is lifted by 'Mark OK', by the referrer's reply,\nor once it has been asked of the referrer (a failed age: only 'Mark OK')\nThe line shortens, then disappears"
click cAcc "Click 'Accept referral and continue'"
process pAcc "Advisory findings are only listed in the Accept dialog\nYou can accept anyway"
goto gAcc "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Referral › Accept a referral"
toast tAcc "Green banner\n'Accepted into IOP. Target admission 10/21/2026.'"
click cCont "Click 'Continue with this referral'"
goto gCont "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Referral › Accept a referral\n(attach the referral to the case; asks first when the agents ran)"
toast tDec "Red banner\n'Declined: Needs a higher level of care.'"
click cRe "Click 'Reopen referral'"
store stRe "Referral is In review again\nDecision cleared"
toast tRe "'Referral reopened'\n'RF-2048 is back In review.'"

decision dCase "Did this referral start a case or a draft?"
click cOpen "Click 'Open the case'"
process pOpen "Opens its request on the case page,\nor its draft at its current step\nIf the draft is the one on screen: goes back to its Intake, where the referral fills the details"
toast tAdm "Calm note 'Admitted'\nLink 'See the full referral'"
goto gCase "Continues in: Authorizations › Case page › Ways in"
goto gMed "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Intake › Initial authorization"

s1 --> sc1
sc1 --> cDiff --> pDiff --> gStart

sc1 --> dAsk
dAsk -->|Yes| cFoot --> gAsk
dAsk -->|No| cDec
sc1 --> cDec --> gOk
sc1 --> dWait
dWait -->|Yes| cDemo --> gAsk
dWait -->|No| cFull
sc1 --> cFull --> gFull

sc1 --> dSt
dSt -->|New, In review, Awaiting info| dReq
dReq -->|Yes| tDis --> pLift
dReq -->|No| cAcc --> pAcc --> gAcc
pLift -.-> cAcc
dSt -->|Accepted or Scheduled| tAcc --> cCont --> gCont
dSt -->|Declined| tDec --> cRe --> stRe --> tRe
dSt -->|Admitted| dCase
dCase -->|Yes| cOpen --> pOpen
pOpen --> gCase
pOpen -.-> gMed
dCase -->|No| tAdm --> gFull
